msgctxt "model:ir.message,text:msg_find_same_related_to"
msgid ""
"You are post for two or more origins that are linked to lines with the same "
"related (%(related_to)s) record and sum more than the related to amount. "
"Please post for only one origin."
msgstr ""
"Esteu comptabilitzant dos o més orígens que estan vinculats a línies amb el "
"mateix registre relacionat (%(related_to)s) i sumen més que l'import "
"relacionat. Publiqueu només per a un origen."

msgctxt "model:ir.message,text:msg_journal_weight_unique"
msgid "Weight Type must be unique per journal."
msgstr "El tipus de pes ha de ser únic per diari."

msgctxt "model:ir.message,text:msg_not_enough_amount_to_pay"
msgid ""
"The invoice has not enougth amount to pay. It's %(amount_to_pay)s € and the "
"origins selected sum %(origins_amount)s €."
msgstr ""
"La factura no té prou import per pagar. Són %(amount_to_pay)s € i els "
"orígens seleccionats sumen %(origins_amount)s €."

msgctxt "model:ir.message,text:msg_not_use_blocked_account_move"
msgid ""
"The suggestion you are trying to use adds move line(s) \"%(move_lines)s\" "
"whose payments are blocked. Are you sure you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"El suggeriment que intentes utilitzar afegeix la línia o línies de moviment "
"\"%(move_lines)s\" els pagaments de la qual estan bloquejats. Segur que vols"
" continuar?"

msgctxt "model:ir.message,text:msg_origin_line_with_move"
msgid ""
"The line has move \"%(move)s\" related to it. Cancel or delete the line will"
" delete that move. Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"La línia té l'assentament \"%(move)s\" relacionat. Cancel·lar o suprimir la "
"línia suprimirà aquest moviment. Voleu continuar?"

msgctxt "model:ir.message,text:msg_origin_lines_with_move"
msgid ""
"The lines \"%(lines)s\" has moves related to it. Cancel or delete lines will"
" delete those moves. Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Les línies \"%(lines)s\" tenen assentaments relacionats. Cancel·lar o "
"suprimir les línies suprimirà aquests moviments. Voleu continuar?"

msgctxt "model:ir.message,text:msg_origin_pending_amount"
msgid ""
"The origin could not be reconciled because the amount of the lines "
"\"%(line_amount)s\" and the amount of the origin \"%(origin_amount)s\" "
"differ."
msgstr ""
"L'orígen no s'ha pogut conciliar perquè el total de les línies "
"\"%(line_amount)s\" i el de l'origen \"%(origin_amount)s\" són diferents."

msgctxt "model:ir.message,text:msg_origins_with_lines"
msgid ""
"The origins \"%(origins)s\" have lines. If you want to use them to pay an "
"Invoice, the related lines will be removed."
msgstr ""
"Els orígens \"%(origins)s\" tenen línies. Si voleu utilitzar-los per pagar "
"una factura, s'eliminaran aquestes línies."

msgctxt "model:ir.message,text:msg_repeated_related_to_used"
msgid ""
"The related \"%(related_to)s\" is usde in a line of the posted origin "
"\"%(origin)s.\""
msgstr ""
"El relacionat \"%(related_to)s\" s'utilitza en una línia de l'origen "
"comptabilitzat \"%(origin)s\"."

msgctxt "model:ir.message,text:msg_statement_line_delete"
msgid ""
"It is not possible to remove the line \"%(line)s\", because the related "
"statement \"%(statement)s\" is validated or posted."
msgstr ""
"No és possible eliminar la línia \"%(line)s\", perquè l'extracte relacionat "
"\"%(statement)s\" està validat o comptabilitzat."

msgctxt "model:ir.message,text:msg_suggested_line_related_to_statement_line"
msgid ""
"There is some suggested line relate to the statement lines of the origins "
"\"%(origins_name)s\". Befeore make a new search, remove the statement line."
msgstr ""
"Hi ha alguna línia suggerida relacionada amb les línies dels origen "
"\"%(origins_name)s\". Abans de fer una cerca nova, elimineu les línies."

